Objective

Rework Alva’s defense/energy presentation and Sphere Rush tick timing while preserving the newly implemented Launch system.

This pass has four primary goals:

1. Charged BA2 tick damage begins immediately when the sphere successfully contacts the opponent.
2. Remove Dodge entirely and make #0001 use Shield as its Defense.
3. Replace the current stamina display/defense economy with a 100-point Energy system visually split into three adjacent bars.
4. Make Shield and the Void visually connected: black/red organic wavy shield circle, and give the Void a thin red outline along its wavy edge.

Do not modify the current Launch Point/Base Launch/Directional Launch architecture except where Shield interaction needs to integrate with hit resolution.

⸻

