The repo already uses the new architecture:

* launchPoint
* baseLaunch
* directionalLaunch
* launchStrength = baseLaunch × launchPoint

Keep that intact.

Do not restore any previous Knockback system.

The existing #0001 damage/launch values remain unchanged:

